Every practical-class PDF for the 2026/2027 academic year, all disciplines, one
folder. Nothing on the site depends on the folder layout — each href in
assets/teaching-data.js is explicit — so the folder is purely for humans, and
one folder per year is what keeps a cohort from overwriting the one before it.

Because the folder is flat, the filename carries the discipline:

    <subject>-<NN>-<lang>.pdf

    stat-01-bg.pdf        medical statistics, class 1, Bulgarian
    ethics-01-en.pdf      medical ethics, class 1, English
    dental-01-en.pdf      dental public health, class 1, English
    socmed-01-bg.pdf      social medicine, class 1, Bulgarian

Two digits so they sort; the subject first so the folder groups by course.

This folder is listed under `resources:` in _quarto.yml, so anything dropped
here is copied to docs/2026-2027-classes/ on the next render.

See _TEACHING-MAINTENANCE.md for the full drop-in checklist.
